oleGraph|HoleMamaCreate|HoleMap|HoleStar1|HoleStar2|HoleStatus|HoleTurnCreate|HoleX1|HoleX2|HoleY1|HoleY2|HullDamage|HullDamageSuspectibility|HullExtraSettings|HullHP|HullSeries|HullSpecial|HullType|Id|IdToHole|IdToItem|IdToPlanet|IdToShip|ImportAll|ImportedFunction|InjectAnswer|int|InterfaceImage|InterfacePos|InterfaceSize|InterfaceState|InterfaceText|InventNewCustomWeapon|IsChameleon|IsFilm|IsPlayer|IsScriptActive|IsShiftCtrlPressed|ItemCanBeBroken|ItemCharge|ItemCost|ItemCount|ItemDestroy|ItemDurability|ItemExist|ItemExtraSpecials|ItemExtraSpecialsAddByType|ItemExtraSpecialsCountByType|ItemExtraSpecialsDeleteByType|ItemFragility|ItemFullName|ItemImprovement|ItemIn|ItemInScript|ItemIsBroken|ItemIsInSet|ItemIsInUse|ItemLevel|ItemName|ItemOnActCode|ItemOnUseCode|ItemOwner|ItemSize|ItemSubrace|ItemType|Keller|KellerKill|KellerLeave|KellerNewResearch|LaunchMissile|libraryfunction|LinkItemToScript|ListBox|ln|loadlibrary|lowercase|MakeShipEnterStar|MarkRobotsMapAsUsed|max|MayAddBonusToEq|MessageBox|MessageBoxYesNo|min|MissileAngle|MissileLive|MissileMaxDamage|MissileMinDamage|MissileOwner|MissileSpeed|MissileStar|MissilesToRearm|MissileTarget|MissileType|MissileWeaponID|ModuleToEquipment|MsgAdd|MusicControls|Name|NearCivilPlanet|NearestGroup|new|newarray|NewsAdd|NoComeKlingToStar|NoDropItem|NoDropToShip|NoJump|NoLanding|NoScanToShip|NoShopUpdate|NoTalkToShip|NoTargetToShip|NumberBox|ObjectType|OnUseCodeBlackHole|OnUseCodeMissileDef|OnUseCodeTranclucator|OnUseCodeTransmitter|OpenCustomForm|OpenExternalLink|ord|OrderFollowShip|OrderForsage|OrderJump|OrderJumpHole|OrderLanding|OrderLock|OrderMove|OrderNone|OrderTakeOff|OrderTeleport|ParsCountFromString|PirateType|PirateWin|PlanetBoostInventions|PlanetCurInvention|PlanetCurInventionPoints|PlanetCustomFaction|PlanetEco|PlanetExtraFlags|PlanetGetGraph|PlanetGov|PlanetInventionLevel|PlanetItems|PlanetItemsHiddency|PlanetName|PlanetNews|PlanetNewsDate|PlanetNewsText|PlanetNewsType|PlanetOrbitalVelocity|PlanetOrbitRadius|PlanetOwner|PlanetPirateClan|PlanetPopulation|PlanetRace|PlanetSetGoods|PlanetSetGraph|PlanetSize|PlanetTerrain|PlanetTerrainExplored|PlanetToStar|PlanetWarriors|Player|PlayerBridge|PlayerChameleonCharges|PlayerChameleonCurType|PlayerChameleonDetected|PlayerDebt|PlayerDebtCnt|PlayerDebtDate|PlayerDeposit|PlayerDepositDate|PlayerDepositDay|PlayerDepositPercent|PlayerDominatorStatistic|PlayerEqSet|PlayerImmunity|PlayerLogicChameleon|PlayerMayTakeSubCrack|PlayerMedPolicy|PlayerPirates|PlayerPlanetaryBattlesCompleted|PlayerQuestInProgress|PlayerQuestsCompleted|PlayerTranclucators|PortionInDiapason|Power|PutItemInVault|QuestsStatusByNom|RaisePirateRank|randomize|randseed|RangerBaseNodes|RangerExcludedFromRating|RangerPlaceInRating|RangersCapital|RangerStatus|RelationToRanger|RelationToShip|ReleaseItemFromScript|ResourceExist|Rnd|RndFloat|RndObject|RobotSupport|round|RoundTo|RuinsAllowModernization|RuinsChangeType|RuinsMicromoduleChain|RunChildForm|RunFunctionFromScript|ScriptActionsRun|ScriptItemActionType|ScriptItemActObject1|ScriptItemActObject2|ScriptItemActParam|ScriptItemActShip|ScriptItemData|ScriptItemTextData|ScriptItemToItem|ScriptRun|SectorVisible|SendStringToClipboard|SeriesCount|SeriesNumInCfg|SetCustomMissileWeaponStats|SetCustomWeaponAvailability|SetCustomWeaponDamageData|SetCustomWeaponPrimaryData|SetCustomWeaponSE|SetCustomWeaponShotData|SetCustomWeaponSizeAndCost|SetData|SetEquipmentStats|SetFocus|SetName|SetParFromString|SetParFromTxt|SetProgramm|SetRangersCapital|SetRelationGroup|SetRelationPlanet|SetShipExpByType|SetShipPath|SFT|ShipAddCustomShipInfo|ShipAddDropItem|ShipAngle|ShipArmor|ShipArts|ShipAverageDamage|ShipCalcParam|ShipCanJump|ShipCanRepairEq|ShipCanUseEq|ShipChangeStar|ShipCntWeapon|ShipConnect|ShipCustomFaction|ShipCustomShipInfoData|ShipCustomShipInfoDescription|ShipCustomShipInfosCount|ShipCustomShipInfoTextData|ShipData|ShipDeleteCustomShipInfo|ShipDestination|ShipDestroy|ShipDestroyType|ShipDroidRepair|ShipEqInSlot|ShipExchangeToShip|ShipFac